@startuml ProcessViewDiagram
autonumber

actor Client
participant "API Router" as Router
participant "Middleware Auth" as Auth
participant "Transfers Handler" as Handler
participant "Transfers Bounded Context" as Transfers
participant "Accounts Bounded Context" as Accounts
participant "Ledger Bounded Context" as Ledger
database "MySQL" as DB

Client -> Router: POST /api/v1/transfers (Idempotency-Key)
Router -> Auth: Validate JWT Token
Auth --> Router: Token Valid
Router -> Handler: Handle Request

Handler -> Transfers: ProcessTransfer(req)
activate Transfers

Transfers -> DB: BEGIN Transaction
activate DB

Transfers -> Transfers: Check Idempotency-Key

Transfers -> Accounts: Lock source & target accounts (FOR UPDATE)
activate Accounts
Accounts -> DB: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE
Accounts --> Transfers: Accounts Locked
deactivate Accounts

Transfers -> Transfers: Verify Sufficient Funds

Transfers -> Ledger: Record Transaction & Entries
activate Ledger
Ledger -> DB: INSERT INTO ledger_entries
Ledger --> Transfers: Entries Recorded
deactivate Ledger

Transfers -> DB: COMMIT Transaction
deactivate DB

Transfers --> Handler: Success
deactivate Transfers

Handler --> Client: 201 Created

@enduml
